                    <sp:Bin_Description>
                        <sp:bin_profile_description>
                            Four of the MVIC detectors sit behind filters. Each band of this image corresponds
                            to one of the filters. For the purposes of this class, the "band center" is calculated
                            as the mathematical midpoint between short and long wavelengths. See the documentation
                            for details of the bandpass for each filter.
                        </sp:bin_profile_description>
